      54→### 4.2 E2E Screenshot Execution & Verification
      55→
      56→```bash
      57→# Ensure asciinema is available (install if needed)
      58→# macOS: brew install asciinema
      59→# Linux: pip install asciinema
      60→
      61→# Run E2E screenshot script
      62→cd snake && ./scripts/e2e-screenshot.sh
